कच्च‍िदज्ञानसम्मोह: प्रणष्टस्ते धनञ्जय ॥ ७२ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4862,\"bb\":4252,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/72/b4252/\",\"body_value\":\"kaccid etac chrutaṁ pārtha
