t-br\",\"ru\",\"sk\",\"hr\",\"pl\",\"da\",\"de\",\"et\",\"fr\",\"hu\",\"ko\",\"lt\",\"nl\",\"sl\",\"uk\",\"ja\"]},\"next\":{\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/74/\",\"title\":\"TEXT 74\",\"has_advanced_view\":false,\"translations\":[\"en\",\"cs\",\"es\",\"bg\",\"pt-br\",\"ru\",\"sk\",\"hr\",\"pl\",\"da\",\"de\",\"et\",\"fr\",\"hu\",\"ko\",\"lt\",\"nl\",\"sl\",\"uk\",\"ja\"]}},\"child_items\":[{\"section\":\"devanagari\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.devanagari\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.DevanagariRecord\",\"title\":\"devanagari\",\"id\":4867,\"bb\":568537,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/73/devanagari/\",\"body_final\":\"नष्टो मोह: स्मृतिर्लब्धा त्वत्प्रसादान्मयाच्युत ।
स्थितोऽस्मि गतसन्देह: करिष्ये वचनं तव ॥ ७३ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4868,\"bb\":4257,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/73/b4257/\",\"body_value\":\"arjuna uvāca
naṣṭo mohaḥ smṛtir labdhā
tvat-prasādān mayācyuta
sthito ’smi gata-sandehaḥ
kariṣye vacanaṁ tava\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4869,\"bb\":4258,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/73/b4258/\",\"shadow_value\":\"arjunaḥ uvāca – Arjuna said; naṣṭaḥ – dispelled; mohaḥ – illusion; smṛtiḥ – memory; labdhā – regained; tvat-prasādāt – by Your mercy; mayā – by me; acyuta – O infallible Kṛṣṇa; sthitaḥ – situated; asmi – I am; gata – removed; sandehaḥ – all doubts; kariṣye – I shall execute; vacanam – order; tava – Your.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"arjunaḥ uvāca\",\"translation\":\"Arjuna said\"},{\"word\":\"naṣṭaḥ\",\"translation\":\"dispelled\"},{\"word\":\"mohaḥ\",\"translation\":\"illusion\"},{\"word\":\"smṛtiḥ\",\"translation\":\"memory\"},{\"word\":\"labdhā\",\"translation\":\"regained\"},{\"word\":\"tvat-prasādāt\",\"translation\":\"by Your mercy\"},{\"word\":\"mayā\",\"translation\":\"by me\"},{\"word\":\"acyuta\",\"translation\":\"O infallible Kṛṣṇa\"},{\"word\":\"sthitaḥ\",\"translation\":\"situated\"},{\"word\":\"asmi\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"gata\",\"translation\":\"removed\"},{\"word\":\"sandehaḥ\",\"translation\":\"all doubts\"},{\"word\":\"kariṣye\",\"translation\":\"I shall execute\"},{\"word\":\"vacanam\",\"translation\":\"order\"},{\"word\":\"tava\",\"translation\":\"Your\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4870,\"bb\":4259,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/73/b4259/\",\"body_value\":\"Arjuna said: My dear Kṛṣṇa, O infallible one, my illusion is now gone. I have regained my memory by Your mercy. I am now firm and free from doubt and am prepared to act according to Your instructions.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4871,\"bb\":4260,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/73/b4260/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4872,\"bb\":4261,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/73/b4261/\",\"body_value\":\"The word moha is very important in this verse. Moha refers to that which is opposed to knowledge. Actually real knowledge is the understanding that every living being is eternally a servitor of the Lord, but instead of thinking oneself in that position, the living entity thinks that he is not a servant, that he is the master of this material world, for he wants to lord it over the material nature. That is his illusion. This illusion can be overcome by the mercy of the Lord or by the mercy of a pure devotee. When that illusion is over, one agrees to act in Kṛṣṇa consciousness.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4873,\"bb\":4262,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/73/b4262/\",\"body_value\":\"$26\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 18.73\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 18.73\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2b:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n31:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n27:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto m