संवादमिममश्रौषमद्भुतं रोमहर्षणम् ॥ ७४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4876,\"bb\":4264,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/74/b4264/\",\"body_value\":\"sañjaya uvāca
ity ahaṁ vāsudevasya
pārthasya ca mahātmanaḥ
saṁvādam imam aśrauṣam
adbhutaṁ roma-harṣaṇam\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4877,\"bb\":4265,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/74/b4265/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sañjayaḥ uvāca – Sañjaya said; iti – thus; aham – I; vāsudevasya – of Kṛṣṇa; pārthasya – and Arjuna; ca – also; mahā-ātmanaḥ – of the great soul; saṁvādam – discussion; imam – this; aśrauṣam – have heard; adbhutam – wonderful; roma-harṣaṇam – making the hair stand on end.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sañjayaḥ uvāca\",\"translation\":\"Sañjaya said\"},{\"word\":\"iti\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I\"},{\"word\":\"vāsudevasya\",\"translation\":\"of Kṛṣṇa\"},{\"word\":\"pārthasya\",\"translation\":\"and Arjuna\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"mahā-ātmanaḥ\",\"translation\":\"of the great soul\"},{\"word\":\"saṁvādam\",\"translation\":\"discussion\"},{\"word\":\"imam\",\"translation\":\"this\"},{\"word\":\"aśrauṣam\",\"translation\":\"have heard\"},{\"word\":\"adbhutam\",\"translation\":\"wonderful\"},{\"word\":\"roma-harṣaṇam\",\"translation\":\"making the hair stand on end\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4878,\"bb\":4266,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/74/b4266/\",\"body_value\":\"Sañjaya said: Thus have I heard the conversation of two great souls, Kṛṣṇa and Arjuna. And so wonderful is that message that my hair is standing on end.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4879,\"bb\":4267,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/74/b4267/\",\"body_value\":\"In the beginning of Bhagavad-gītā, Dhṛtarāṣṭra inquired from his secretary Sañjaya, “What happened on the Battlefield of Kurukṣetra?” The entire study was related to the heart of Sañjaya by the grace of his spiritual master, Vyāsa. He thus explained the theme of the battlefield. The conversation was wonderful because such an important conversation between two great souls had never taken place before and would not take place again. It was wonderful because the Supreme Personality of Godhead was speaking about Himself and His energies to the living entity, Arjuna, a great devotee of the Lord. If we follow in the footsteps of Arjuna to understand Kṛṣṇa, then our life will be happy and successful. Sañjaya realized this, and as he began to understand it, he related the conversation to Dhṛtarāṣṭra. Now it is concluded that wherever there is Kṛṣṇa and Arjuna, there is victory.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 18.74\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 18.74\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\"