केशवार्जुनयो: पुण्यं हृष्यामि च मुहुर्मुहु: ॥ ७६ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4890,\"bb\":4276,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/76/b4276/\",\"body_value\":\"rājan saṁsmṛtya saṁsmṛtya
saṁvādam imam adbhutam
keśavārjunayoḥ puṇyaṁ
hṛṣyāmi ca muhur muhuḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4891,\"bb\":4277,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/76/b4277/\",\"shadow_value\":\"rājan – O King; saṁsmṛtya – remembering; saṁsmṛtya – remembering; saṁvādam – message; imam – this; adbhutam – wonderful; keśava – of Lord Kṛṣṇa; arjunayoḥ – and Arjuna; puṇyam – pious; hṛṣyāmi – I am taking pleasure; ca – also; muhuḥ muhuḥ – repeatedly.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"rājan\",\"translation\":\"O King\"},{\"word\":\"saṁsmṛtya\",\"translation\":\"remembering\"},{\"word\":\"saṁsmṛtya\",\"translation\":\"remembering\"},{\"word\":\"saṁvādam\",\"translation\":\"message\"},{\"word\":\"imam\",\"translation\":\"this\"},{\"word\":\"adbhutam\",\"translation\":\"wonderful\"},{\"word\":\"keśava\",\"translation\":\"of Lord Kṛṣṇa\"},{\"word\":\"arjunayoḥ\",\"translation\":\"and Arjuna\"},{\"word\":\"puṇyam\",\"translation\":\"pious\"},{\"word\":\"hṛṣyāmi\",\"translation\":\"I am taking pleasure\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"muhuḥ muhuḥ\",\"translation\":\"repeatedly\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4892,\"bb\":4278,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/76/b4278/\",\"body_value\":\"O King, as I repeatedly recall this wondrous and holy dialogue between Kṛṣṇa and Arjuna, I take pleasure, being thrilled at every moment.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4893,\"bb\":4279,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/76/b4279/\",\"body_value\":\"The understanding of Bhagavad-gītā is so transcendental that anyone who becomes conversant with the topics of Arjuna and Kṛṣṇa becomes righteous and he cannot forget such talks. This is the transcendental position of spiritual life. In other words, one who hears the Gītā from the right source, directly from Kṛṣṇa, attains full Kṛṣṇa consciousness. The result of Kṛṣṇa consciousness is that one becomes increasingly enlightened, and he enjoys life with a thrill, not only for some time, but at every moment.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 18.76\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 18.76\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Library\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/bg/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/bg/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/bg/18/\",{\"className\":\"inline